{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style>\r\n.ds-wrap{max-width:790px;margin:0 auto;font-family:'Pretendard','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;line-height:1.75;color:#1C1C1C;background:#FFFFFF;font-size:15px;}\r\n.ds-wrap,.ds-wrap *{box-sizing:border-box;}\r\n.ds-wrap img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;}\r\n.ds-wrap figure{margin:0;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-hero{width:100%;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-intro{padding:26px 0 8px;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-kicker{font-size:13px;color:#123628;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px;}\r\n.ds-wrap h2{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.4;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-define{color:#616161;margin:0;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-block-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#1C1C1C;margin:32px 0 14px;padding-left:10px;border-left:4px solid #123628;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-caption{font-size:13px;color:#616161;margin:10px 0 0;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-drawing{padding:20px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-drawing img{width:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:560px;margin:0 auto;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid #E0E0E0;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table th{background:#F8F8F8;color:#616161;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:13px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E0E0E0;width:30%;text-align:left;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table td{background:#FFFFFF;color:#1C1C1C;font-size:15px;padding:13px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E0E0E0;text-align:left;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-reason{background:#F8F8F8;border:1px solid #E0E0E0;border-top:2px solid #123628;border-radius:6px;padding:18px;margin:0;color:#616161;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-reason ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-reason li+li{margin-top:8px;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-faq{margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-faq-item{background:#F8F8F8;border:1px solid #E0E0E0;border-radius:6px;padding:15px 16px;margin:0 0 12px;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-faq-q{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#123628;margin:0 0 6px;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-faq-a{font-size:14px;color:#616161;margin:0;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-cta{display:block;width:100%;background:#123628;color:#FFFFFF;padding:16px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-cta:hover{opacity:0.92;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-phone{color:#616161;font-size:13px;text-align:center;margin:0 0 20px;}\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-footer{background:#123628;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:center;padding:20px;font-size:13px;}\r\n@media(max-width:768px){.ds-wrap{padding:0 16px;font-size:13px;}.ds-wrap h2{font-size:20px;}.ds-wrap .ds-block-title{font-size:16px;}.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table th,.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table td{display:block;width:100%;font-size:13px;}.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table th{border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:4px;}.ds-wrap .ds-spec-table td{padding-top:4px;}.ds-wrap .ds-cta{font-size:14px;}.ds-wrap .ds-faq-q{font-size:14px;}.ds-wrap .ds-faq-a{font-size:13px;}}\r\n\r\n.ds-wrap .ds-product-title{padding:26px 0 18px;margin:0;}.ds-wrap .ds-overview{margin:20px 0 0;color:#616161;}.ds-wrap .ds-overview p{margin:0 0 6px;}.ds-wrap .ds-detail-image{width:100%;}.ds-wrap .ds-note{font-size:13px;color:#616161;}.ds-wrap .ds-faq{margin-top:24px;}</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n<div id=\"ds-domus-easy-hinge-ni\" class=\"ds-wrap\"><h2 class=\"ds-product-title\">도무스 이지경첩 NI (1조)</h2><figure><img width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"도무스 이지경첩 NI 니켈 색상 경첩 본체 단품 참고 사진\" class=\"ds-hero\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/prod_detail/infographic/domus/easy-hinge-ni/main-01.jpg\" /></figure><p class=\"ds-caption\">사진은 본체 단품 참고용입니다. 판매 단위 1조는 본체 3개입입니다.</p><div class=\"ds-overview\"><p class=\"ds-kicker\">한눈에 보기</p><p>접히는 날개와 체결 구멍을 갖춘 니켈 색상의 경첩입니다.</p></div><h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">제품 디테일</h3><figure><img width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"도무스 이지경첩 NI 펼친 경첩 날개와 체결 구멍을 보여주는 NI 단독 사진\" class=\"ds-detail-image\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/prod_detail/infographic/domus/easy-hinge-ni/photo-03.jpg\" /><figcaption class=\"ds-caption\">촬영 조명과 화면 설정에 따라 실제 색상이 다르게 보일 수 있습니다.</figcaption></figure><h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">제품 치수</h3><figure class=\"ds-drawing\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"도무스 이지경첩 NI 공식 치수 사진, 제조사 표기 규격 58 × 102mm\" class=\"ds-drawing-image\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/prod_detail/infographic/domus/easy-hinge-ni/size-01.jpg\" /></figure><h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">규격 정보</h3><table class=\"ds-spec-table\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">브랜드</th><td>DOMUS</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">모델</th><td>이지경첩 NI</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">규격</th><td>58 × 102mm</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">재질</th><td>금속</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">색상 / 마감</th><td>니켈</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">판매 단위</th><td>1조</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">1조 구성</th><td>경첩 본체 3개입</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"ds-caption\">규격·재질·마감은 도무스 공식 상세 기준, 1조 구성은 대산 출고 기준입니다.</p><h3 class=\"ds-block-title\">구매 전 확인사항</h3><div class=\"ds-reason\"><ul><li>문과 문틀의 상태, 경첩 설치 위치 및 체결 방식을 확인해 주세요.</li><li>나사 동봉 여부와 수량은 구매 전 확인해 주세요.</li><li>기존 경첩 교체 시 치수와 체결 위치를 확인해 주세요.</li></ul></div><div class=\"ds-faq\"></div><a class=\"ds-cta\" href=\"https://web-cadalog-ver10.vercel.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">대량구매 견적 · 규격 확인하기 →</a>\r\n<div class=\"ds-phone\">전화 031-388-3833 · 평일 09:00–18:00</div>\r\n<div class=\"ds-footer\">(주)대산 · 35년 신뢰의 건축자재 전문 공급사</div></div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}